---
interface Props {
  id?: string;
  updatedOn?: string;
}

const { id, updatedOn = 'August 2026' } = Astro.props;
---

<section id={id} class="trust-signals" aria-label="Trust and freshness">
  <h2>Trust and freshness policy</h2>
  <div class="trust-signals__list">
    <details class="trust-signals__item">
      <summary>
        <span>Who writes this content?</span>
        <span class="trust-signals__chevron" aria-hidden="true">▾</span>
      </summary>
      <p>Content is written by Ali Zain (methezain), an AI engineer focused on production systems.</p>
    </details>

    <details class="trust-signals__item">
      <summary>
        <span>How are claims verified?</span>
        <span class="trust-signals__chevron" aria-hidden="true">▾</span>
      </summary>
      <p>Outcome claims are based on shipped projects with measurable context.</p>
    </details>

    <details class="trust-signals__item">
      <summary>
        <span>Where is the evidence trail?</span>
        <span class="trust-signals__chevron" aria-hidden="true">▾</span>
      </summary>
      <p>Proof appears in <a href="/work" data-cursor="view">AI case studies</a> and implementation detail in <a href="/blog" data-cursor="view">technical notes</a>.</p>
    </details>

    <details class="trust-signals__item">
      <summary>
        <span>How often is content reviewed?</span>
        <span class="trust-signals__chevron" aria-hidden="true">▾</span>
      </summary>
      <p>Core pages are reviewed monthly. Last reviewed {updatedOn}.</p>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .trust-signals h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
  }
  .trust-signals__list {
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.95rem;
  }
  .trust-signals__item {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--surface);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .trust-signals__item summary {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    min-height: 3.6rem;
    padding: 0.95rem 1rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    user-select: none;
  }
  .trust-signals__item summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }
  .trust-signals__item summary span:first-child {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .trust-signals__chevron {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--muted);
    transform: rotate(0deg);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  .trust-signals__item[open] .trust-signals__chevron {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }
  .trust-signals__item p {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0 1rem 1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .trust-signals a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }
</style>
